    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8220" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεμέσητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέμεσις</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not incurring the wrath of God,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				401a
			</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ-ητον εἰπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					195a
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>not liable to blame,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. [ἐστι] . . τινί,</span> c.
			inf., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				175e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.66
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				161
			</span></i>,etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					684e
				</span></i>
			.</div>
